i0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Workout\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Watched Suits\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Monday \u8226? 6-22-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Ran errands, visited Dallas and learned about JFK assassination, worked out, and grind Wizard 101. Solid day.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Dropped off Val @HEB\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Amazon return\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   6th Floor Museum\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Skyfall Park\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Picked up Val @HEB\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Workout\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Sunday \u8226? 6-21-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 A great Sunday well spent. Slow but productive with the activities I like doing.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Bean\u8217?s booster\u8217?s appointment\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Workout\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Shrooms\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Nap\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Lunch @Texas Roadhouse\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Saturday \u8226? 6-20-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Tried a new Vietnamese spot and ate Ban Xeo, went across the street to get coffee in a new district. Escape 360 Cafe was too packed to study at. Booked Hawaii\u8217?s AirBnb and did research in Hawaii. Excited to go to Hawaii for the second time.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Lunch @District One Saigon Street Food\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Trung Nguyen E-Coffee\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Book Hawaii AirBnb\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Nap\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Friday \u8226? 6-19-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Started the day off slow since we went to Red River last night. Got groceries, napped, an hour of Vietnamese, and stayed up playing Wizard 101.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   HEB\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Nap\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Studied Vietnamese\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Thursday \u8226? 6-18-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 A great day to be unemployed. Grinded Wizard 101, napped and went to Red River w Val's friends.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Workout\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Studied Vietnamese\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Nap\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Red River\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Wednesday \u8226? 6-17-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Woke up early to go to the HEB grand opening and saw Manish and his friend. I'm happy we have an HEB 12 mins aways from the apartment now. Explored downtown for a bit looking at the murals then went home to spend the rest of the day in. A great first day back home.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   HEB grand opening\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Workout\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Deep Ellum murals\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Nap\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Tuesday \u8226? 6-16-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 The end of our Austin trip. I enjoyed traveling to a different city but it's good to be back home. Woke up and left the hotel at 10am and headed home to Dallas. Picked up the cats and did chores whenever we got home. Played Wizard 101 till midnight last night.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Drove back to Dallas\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Picked up the cats\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Chores\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Setup passport appointment\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Monday \u8226? 6-15-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Day 5 in Austin. Woke up and left the AirBnb around 10am and headed straight to the Longhorn Cavern State Park. They work on an appointment basis so we had to wait till 12:30pm to get into the 1.5 hr long guided tour. It was cool seeing the cavern and taking pictures but I was ready to eat and nap. We went to the hotel and ate and napped for an hour. We woke up and went to Mount Bonnell and took pictures on top of the famous picnic table then left to go watch the bats fly out of the bridge after sunset. They didn\u8217?t all fly out at once, which is better during July-August, but it was still a fun and unique experience.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Longhorn Cavern State Park\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Hotel\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Nap\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Mount Bonnell\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Watched bats under the bridge\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Sunday \u8226? 6-14-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Day 4 in Austin. First time driving a boat and it was fun getting in the water and seeing the views from Lake Travis. After boating, everyone was tired so they just stayed at the AirBnb and went to the pool. Me and Val went to the mall to get coffee and boba but we got rained on. After it stopped raining we went to Pease Park and found out that the wooden statue was burnt down at night. We tried to go to the Cathedral of Junk however it\u8217?s located in someone\u8217?s backyard and he operates on an appointment only basis. We then headed home to go grill and saw that the grill at the AirBnb didn\u8217?t work so I went to HEB to get my own grill. Me and David built the grill and Gabe helped cook the food. Bacon is hard to cook on the grill. We ate dinner and watched Sean O Malley fight. Long day, everything didn\u8217?t go as planned but I\u8217?m glad I went as a learning experience.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Boating on Lake Travis\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   The Domain Mall\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Boba @Mylo\u8217?s\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Pease Park\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Cathedral of Junk\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   HEB\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Dinner\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Watched UFC fight\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Saturday \u8226? 6-13-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Day 3 in Austin. A day in downtown. Went to try a brunch spot called Two Hands but was a 1 hour wait so we went to Fat Rabbit. After brunch we walked to the Texas Capital while stopping by random stores. The Texas Capital\u8217?s architecture was beautiful and free. We then walked through the heat to an art museum that didn\u8217?t have AC. Took an Uber back to the car and went to get BBQ. They didn\u8217?t have a lot of options there but it was still a solid BBQ spot. We spent the rest of the day inside hanging by the pool and watching the Spurs vs Knicks game. Rip Spurs. A long and eventful day in Austin.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Brunch @Fat Rabbit\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Texas Capital\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Blanton Museum of Art\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Lunch @Interstellar BBQ\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Pool\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Spurs vs Knicks Game 5\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Friday \u8226? 6-12-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Day 2 in Austin. Went to an outdoor museum and a bakery before meeting up with David & Mar. Then went to the AirBnb to check it out and had the weirdest interaction with a crackhead lady with supposedly a car with a broken transmission. She needs help pushing her car in reverse and then left the premises. Me and David just helped a homeless person leave. Then we chilled for 2 hours and went to go eat at the Oasis. The views were insane and got some cool pictures of Lake Travis. Ended the night in the pool talking and listening to music. A busy, dense and fun day in Austin\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   The Contemporary Austin - Laguna Gloria\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Sugarwolf Bakery\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   HEB\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   AirBnb\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Dinner @The Oasis on Lake Travis\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Pool\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Thursday \u8226? 6-11-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Day 1 in Austin. Dropped off the cats and headed to Austin!!! Explored downtown by walking the city. We ended up going to the Contemporary Austin Museum\u8212?which was free and lowkey small and mid\u8212?and the Museum of the Weird\u8212?which was quite unique and a different experience. We then went to the mall where we checked out the mall and bought some swim shorts @Hollister. Got some food downtown and getting pizza for the hotel. Life is good.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Drop Bean and Obama @Steven\u8217?s\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Drive to Austin\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   The Contemporary Austin - Jones Center\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Museum of the Weird\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Lunch @Taqueria De Diez\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Shopping @Barton Creek Square\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Dinner @Dominos\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Wednesday \u8226? 6-10-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Productive day doing the things I love while staying productive. Just doing hobbies that keep me engaged that will transfer to my life.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Chores\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Apply for unemployment\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Workout\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Studied Vietnamese\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Nap\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Packed for Austin\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Tuesday \u8226? 6-9-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Starting today I have 107 days until I go to Vietnam. WIthin this time I will try my best to dedicate 1 hour to learning Vietnamese. Along with enjoying life and exploring cities, I'll learn Vietnamese since this is one of the my life goals to learn Vietnamese. In Vietnam I want to be able to greet people, be polite, order food and drinks, handle simple conversations and understand numbers. If I want to reach for the stars then I would want to make a new friend.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Workout\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Studied Vietnamese\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Monday \u8226? 6-8-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 Helped Steven buy a car around lunch time. Steven did end up buying me and Val lunch @Chick Fli La which was nice. Did chores, and grind Wizard 101 for the rest of the day. Day well spent.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Helped Steven buy a car\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Lunch @Chick Fil La\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Spurs vs Knicks Game 3\par \li0\fi0 \par \b Sunday \u8226? 6-7-2026\b0\par \li0\fi0 A busy day doing the things I love. Exploring Dallas by going to the Reunion tower, Pioneer Plaza, Cattle Drive and spending time outside. We stopped by Gabe & Marianne\u8217?s apartment to show bean. A day well spent.\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Wizard 101 grind\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Workout\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Grapevine Mall\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Reunion tower\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?   Snack @McDonalds\par \li0\fi0 \u8211?